cText invariant none
cText typeParameter none
cText input text String borrowed
cText output machine.Address
cText outputOwnedBy none
cText raises none
cText effect use machine.memory
cText effect use system.calls
cText uses memoryAccess
cText uses systemCalls
cText memoryHeap false
cText async false
cText maxRecursion none
cText label begin loopKind none
cText label begin within none
cText let one Int64 1 immutable
cText at begin do readBytes
cText at begin do blockStep1
cText at begin do readBlock
cText at begin do readAt
cText at begin do doCopy
cText at begin return ok block

