ruleZoneTest is test
ruleZoneTest purpose "A POSIX rule gives the standard and the daylight offset on either side of each change, in the northern and the southern hemisphere, and reads a quoted name and an offset with minutes"
ruleZoneTest verifies parsePosix readsRule
