formatTest is test
formatTest purpose "strftime writes every conversion glibc has in the C locale, the flags _ - 0 ^ #, widths, and the E and O modifiers; text that does not fit stops it with 0 and what was written before stays"
formatTest verifies formatTime formatsLikeGlibc
